// audit-ci configuration — the BLOCKING dependency-audit gate in CI (required-gates).
//
// Fails the build on any high or critical advisory. The allowlist is EMPTY and
// should stay that way: every advisory that was previously accepted here
// (next's bundled postcss/sharp, eslint's brace-expansion) now has a fix
// reachable by lockfile bump alone, applied via `npm audit fix`.
//
// If a new high/critical lands with no non-breaking fix, add its GHSA id below
// WITH a comment naming the package, the reason no fix is adoptable, and a
// review date. Adding an ID is accepting a known risk — never do it silently.
{
  "$schema": "https://github.com/IBM/audit-ci/raw/main/docs/schema.json",
  "high": true,
  "allowlist": []
}
